  "id": "corn-coconut-and-lentil-chowder",
  "name": "Corn, Coconut, and Lentil Chowder",
  "subtitle": "A warming lentil chowder with sweetcorn, spice, and coconut yogurt.",
  "description": "Cook aromatics and spices, simmer the lentils and vegetables until tender, then finish with coconut yogurt and coriander for a creamy, hearty soup.",
